# Chart and pipe

Pipe `ref` and `basechart-deployment` version come from `users-actions` `init`. Same pair on every service. Do not leave an older pair.

Leave `values-prod.yaml` as it is in the service. Do not copy microservice values onto a gateway or rewrite prod values from the template.

`chart/` has `Chart.yaml` and `values-prod.yaml` only. Delete `values-dev-*`.

```yaml
include:
  - project: "rutdigital/devops/pipelines_general/build_deploy_docker"
    file: "pipe.yaml"
    ref: "2.0.2"
```
